[
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.1",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Paul, a prisoner of Jesus Christ, and Timothy our brother, unto Philemon our dearly beloved, and fellowlabourer,",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.2",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And to our beloved Apphia, and Archippus our fellowsoldier, and to the church in thy house:",
    "chunk_index": 1,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.3",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Grace to you, and peace, from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ.",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.4",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.4",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "I thank my God, making mention of thee always in my prayers,",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.5",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.5",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Hearing of thy love and faith, which thou hast toward the Lord Jesus, and toward all saints;",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.6",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.6",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "That the communication of thy faith may become effectual by the acknowledging of every good thing which is in you in Christ Jesus.",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.7",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.7",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "For we have great joy and consolation in thy love, because the bowels of the saints are refreshed by thee, brother.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.8",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.8",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Wherefore, though I might be much bold in Christ to enjoin thee that which is convenient,",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.9",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.9",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Yet for love’s sake I rather beseech thee, being such an one as Paul the aged, and now also a prisoner of Jesus Christ.",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.10",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.10",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "I beseech thee for my son Onesimus, whom I have begotten in my bonds:",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.11",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.11",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Which in time past was to thee unprofitable, but now profitable to thee and to me:",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.12",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.12",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Whom I have sent again: thou therefore receive him, that is, mine own bowels:",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.13",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.13",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Whom I would have retained with me, that in thy stead he might have ministered unto me in the bonds of the gospel:",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.14",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.14",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "But without thy mind would I do nothing; that thy benefit should not be as it were of necessity, but willingly.",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.15",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.15",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "For perhaps he therefore departed for a season, that thou shouldest receive him for ever;",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.16",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.16",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Not now as a servant, but above a servant, a brother beloved, specially to me, but how much more unto thee, both in the flesh, and in the Lord?",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.17",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.17",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "If thou count me therefore a partner, receive him as myself.",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.18",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.18",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "If he hath wronged thee, or oweth thee ought, put that on mine account;",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.19",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.19",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "I Paul have written it with mine own hand, I will repay it: albeit I do not say to thee how thou owest unto me even thine own self besides.",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.20",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.20",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Yea, brother, let me have joy of thee in the Lord: refresh my bowels in the Lord.",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.21",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.21",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Having confidence in thy obedience I wrote unto thee, knowing that thou wilt also do more than I say.",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.22",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.22",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "But withal prepare me also a lodging: for I trust that through your prayers I shall be given unto you.",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.23",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.23",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "There salute thee Epaphras, my fellowprisoner in Christ Jesus;",
    "chunk_index": 22,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.24",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.24",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Marcus, Aristarchus, Demas, Lucas, my fellowlabourers.",
    "chunk_index": 23,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm#Phlm.1.25",
    "work_id": "scripture/kjv/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.25",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with your spirit. Amen.",
    "chunk_index": 24,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  }
]